    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is it called &quot;NYXverse&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NYX (\u039d\u03cd\u03be) is the Greek goddess of night in Greek mythology, who gave birth to &quot;dreams&quot; and &quot;fate.&quot; NYXverse signifies our aspiration to build a world where everyone can shape their own dreams and destinies\u2014a free space filled with creativity and diverse, wonderful dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of &quot;game&quot; is this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, we can't really define it precisely, especially when most of the experience is built on &quot;AI-generated content.&quot; All we can say is that this is a product featuring tens of thousands of 3D AI-driven characters, where players enjoy complete freedom to create stories and scripts. It's also one that will continuously evolve with new and entertaining AI-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Chat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the AI companion using your text, or go ahead and use voice chat, even send images or gifts to strengthen your connection and deepen your relationship over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.poster.avif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.webm?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/1d0ea3bb3b5c971416a15a95faf9f88a.poster.avif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/1d0ea3bb3b5c971416a15a95faf9f88a.webm?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/1d0ea3bb3b5c971416a15a95faf9f88a.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/54857b5bac5936a7396fc313a34b1a41.poster.avif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/54857b5bac5936a7396fc313a34b1a41.webm?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/54857b5bac5936a7396fc313a34b1a41.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Your Ideal AI Companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your perfect match among tens of thousands of unique AI entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/c4ef9000d237295e718f438beedc9294.poster.avif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/c4ef9000d237295e718f438beedc9294.webm?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/c4ef9000d237295e718f438beedc9294.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own AI Companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload content, customize appearances, design from scratch, or use any DIY method you can think of to bring your unique AI to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u4e0a\u4f20\u6a21\u578b.gif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Generated Scripts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks and storylines that evolve differently based on every action you take and every word you speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u5267\u672c\u4efb\u52a1.gif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intimate Interactions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about lying in bed together to listen to a bedtime story? Or engaging in a deep conversation about an interesting piece of art? Give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for even more unique ways to interact? We can't wait for you to discover them!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is it called &quot;NYXverse&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NYX (\u039d\u03cd\u03be) is the Greek goddess of night in Greek mythology, who gave birth to &quot;dreams&quot; and &quot;fate.&quot; NYXverse signifies our aspiration to build a world where everyone can shape their own dreams and destinies\u2014a free space filled with creativity and diverse, wonderful dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of &quot;game&quot; is this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, we can't really define it precisely, especially when most of the experience is built on &quot;AI-generated content.&quot; All we can say is that this is a product featuring tens of thousands of 3D AI-driven characters, where players enjoy complete freedom to create stories and scripts. It's also one that will continuously evolve with new and entertaining AI-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Chat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the AI companion using your text, or go ahead and use voice chat, even send images or gifts to strengthen your connection and deepen your relationship over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.poster.avif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.webm?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/b9b472af6b376c837260172c90d1c365.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl