7295e718f438beedc9294.mp4?t=1746179922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own AI Companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload content, customize appearances, design from scratch, or use any DIY method you can think of to bring your unique AI to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u4e0a\u4f20\u6a21\u578b.gif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Generated Scripts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks and storylines that evolve differently based on every action you take and every word you speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u5267\u672c\u4efb\u52a1.gif?t=1746179922\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intimate Interactions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about lying in bed together to listen to a bedtime story? Or engaging in a deep conversation about an interesting piece of art? Give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for even more unique ways to interact? We can't wait for you to discover them!</p>",
